{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-challenges","title":"多模态检索挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multimodal-rag/foundations/multimodal-challenges","wordCount":1591,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"多模态检索挑战\">多模态检索挑战</h1><p>决定要做多模态 RAG 之后，第一件清醒的事是承认它比单模态难得多，而且难点不止一处。把「难」笼统地挂在嘴上没有用，工程上要做的是把它拆成几类可命名、可分别下手的困难。这一节就是这张困难地图——每一类困难都对应后面某一章的一个具体设计决策，读懂它你才知道那些设计为什么长成那样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多模态检索的困难可以拆成四类互不相同、各有对策的问题：模态鸿沟（表示层）、检索粒度（单元层）、异构证据的排序与冲突（融合层）、以及评测困难（度量层）。把它们逐一命名清楚，本 hub 后三章的每个设计决策才有明确的针对对象。本节就是这张「困难—解法」索引表，下面四节分别展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模态鸿沟-图和文不在同一个空间\">模态鸿沟：图和文不在同一个空间</h2><p>最底层的困难是表示。一段文字经过文本嵌入模型落在一个向量空间里，一张图经过视觉编码器落在另一个空间里，两个空间的坐标轴含义毫不相干，直接算相似度等于拿苹果比里程。要让「文本查询」召回「图片文档」，必须先有一个把两种模态对齐到同一空间的机制。</p>\n<p>形式上，跨模态检索希望学到两个编码器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\text{text}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>img</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\text{img}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">img</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使得语义相关的图文对的相似度高、无关对的相似度低，典型用对比损失逼近：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>img</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>d</mi></munder><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>img</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = -\\log \\frac{\\exp(\\text{sim}(f_\\text{text}(q), f_\\text{img}(d^+)) / \\tau)}{\\sum_{d} \\exp(\\text{sim}(f_\\text{text}(q), f_\\text{img}(d)) / \\tau)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.434em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4483em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">img</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">text</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">img</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是温度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是正样本。CLIP 系模型证明了这条路可行，但「对齐到同一空间」本身有损：图被压成一个向量时，版面、表格里的具体数字这些细节会被平均掉。如何在对齐的同时保住细粒度，是后面延迟交互方案要解决的核心矛盾。对比学习与温度的训练细节属于嵌入本身，见跨库的 <a href=\"../../text-embeddings-representation/training/contrastive-learning\">对比学习</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检索粒度-整页-区块还是元素\">检索粒度：整页、区块还是元素</h2><p>第二类困难是「检索的单位是什么」。同一页文档可以被当作一个整页图片、可以被切成若干语义块、也可以细到单个表格或单张图。粒度太粗，召回一整页却让生成模型在一堆无关内容里大海捞针；粒度太细，又会切断表格与其标题、图与其说明文字之间的关联。</p>\n<p>下表对比三种粒度的权衡，它直接预告了 <a href=\"../indexing/document-parsing\">文档解析与版面</a> 与 <a href=\"../indexing/visual-embeddings-colpali\">视觉嵌入与 ColPali</a> 两节的分工。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检索粒度</th>\n<th>召回单元</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整页</td>\n<td>一页图片</td>\n<td>保住版面与上下文，免 OCR</td>\n<td>单元粗，生成端负担重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义块</td>\n<td>标题/段落/表/图</td>\n<td>粒度合适，证据精确</td>\n<td>依赖可靠的版面解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元素</td>\n<td>一格/一条曲线</td>\n<td>最精确</td>\n<td>解析极难，关联易断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>没有哪种粒度永远最优——它取决于文档类型与下游 VLM 的上下文承载力，这也是为什么本 hub 把「整页」与「区块」两条路都讲透，而不是钦定一种。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异构证据的排序与冲突\">异构证据的排序与冲突</h2><p>第三类困难出现在召回之后。一次查询可能同时命中两段文字、一张图、一个表格，它们来自不同模态、相似度分数不在同一量纲上——文本相似度 0.8 和图文相似度 0.8 不是一回事。怎么把它们放进一个统一的排序里？更棘手的是冲突：文字说「增长」，图却画着「下降」（往往因为版本不一致或解析错位），系统该信谁？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[查询] --&gt; T[文本命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲A]&#10;  Q --&gt; I[图像命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲B]&#10;  Q --&gt; B[表格命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲C]&#10;  T --&gt; M{跨模态归一与重排}&#10;  I --&gt; M&#10;  B --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; C{证据冲突?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| R[按来源可信度&lt;br/&gt;或时效裁决]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| F[融合为统一上下文]&#10;  R --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n  Q[查询] --&gt; T[文本命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲A]\n  Q --&gt; I[图像命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲B]\n  Q --&gt; B[表格命中&lt;br/&gt;score 量纲C]\n  T --&gt; M{跨模态归一与重排}\n  I --&gt; M\n  B --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; C{证据冲突?}\n  C --&gt;|是| R[按来源可信度&lt;br/&gt;或时效裁决]\n  C --&gt;|否| F[融合为统一上下文]\n  R --&gt; F</pre><p>这类困难在本 hub 分两处解决：分数归一与重排属于 <a href=\"../retrieval-gen/cross-modal-retrieval\">跨模态检索</a>，冲突裁决与上下文组装属于 <a href=\"../retrieval-gen/modality-fusion\">模态融合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评测的困难-传统指标抓不住跨模态忠实\">评测的困难：传统指标抓不住跨模态忠实</h2><p>第四类困难常被低估：你很难判断系统好不好。纯文本 RAG 可以用召回率、答案与参考的文本相似度来量，但多模态场景里，「图读对没有」「答案有没有忠实于那张图」这种忠实度，文本指标根本测不到。2026 年的研究反复指出，视觉语言模型对图像证据的 groundedness 系统性地弱于文本证据，而这种弱恰恰是文本相似度指标的盲区——答案可以读错图却依然流畅得分很高。</p>\n<p>这迫使多模态评测引入新的度量与基准（UniDoc-Bench、MMDocRAG、带视觉引用的 FinRAGBench-V 等），把检索、融合、生成分阶段地量。完整的评测方法论是 <a href=\"../practice/mmrag-evaluation\">多模态 RAG 评测</a> 的主题，本节只点明：评测难本身就是一类一等公民的挑战，不是事后才想的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"困难地图与设计决策的对应\">困难地图与设计决策的对应</h2><p>把四类困难和它们的解处对齐，就得到本 hub 的内在逻辑：模态鸿沟 → 视觉/跨模态嵌入；检索粒度 → 解析与索引；异构排序与冲突 → 检索与融合；评测困难 → 评测与幻觉。这四条线索正好对应后三章。换句话说，这一节不是抱怨困难，而是给出了整个 hub 的「问题—解法」索引表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>模态鸿沟：图文落在不同向量空间，必须对齐；对齐到单向量会损失细粒度，是延迟交互方案的动机。</li>\n<li>检索粒度：整页/区块/元素各有权衡，由文档类型与 VLM 上下文承载力决定，无统一最优。</li>\n<li>异构排序与冲突：跨模态分数量纲不一、证据可能矛盾，需归一重排 + 冲突裁决。</li>\n<li>评测困难：文本指标测不到跨模态忠实度，VLM 对图像 groundedness 系统性偏弱，需专门基准。</li>\n<li>四类困难一一对应后三章的设计决策，是本 hub 的问题—解法索引。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>动机与失效场景：<a href=\"why-multimodal-rag\">为何多模态 RAG</a></li>\n<li>三种应对架构的取舍：<a href=\"mmrag-architectures\">架构谱系</a></li>\n<li>跨库——对比学习与温度（模态对齐的训练机制）：<a href=\"../../text-embeddings-representation/training/contrastive-learning\">对比学习</a></li>\n<li>跨库——VLM 的视觉 grounding 与幻觉根源：<a href=\"../../vision-language-models/practice/visual-hallucination\">视觉幻觉</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多模态检索挑战","id":"多模态检索挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模态鸿沟：图和文不在同一个空间","id":"模态鸿沟-图和文不在同一个空间"},{"level":2,"text":"检索粒度：整页、区块还是元素","id":"检索粒度-整页-区块还是元素"},{"level":2,"text":"异构证据的排序与冲突","id":"异构证据的排序与冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"评测的困难：传统指标抓不住跨模态忠实","id":"评测的困难-传统指标抓不住跨模态忠实"},{"level":2,"text":"困难地图与设计决策的对应","id":"困难地图与设计决策的对应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"为何多模态 RAG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multimodal-rag/foundations/why-multimodal-rag"},"next":{"title":"架构谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/multimodal-rag/foundations/mmrag-architectures"}}